        "created_at": "2012-08-23T03:11:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That's true. When we played Ambuscade a few days ago at Gen Con, he got a ton of combos, but that was without absorbing his gadgets. He got \"Run 'n' Gun\", we reshuffled, and he got it again. And this happened in two different turns. Then he got a \"Run 'n' Gun\" and \"Quick Stim-Patch\" combo, so he was pretty much playing three cards every turn.</p>",
