        "created_at": "2012-09-06T07:14:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Christopher\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/48/1851_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Christopher:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Legacy is a team-booster.&nbsp; Baron Blade prefers to not fight his own fights.</p>\n<p>Tempest has lots of area attacks that do damage to multiple targets.&nbsp; Grand Warlord Voss supplies plenty of targets.</p>\n<p>Mr. Fixer is one man against the world.&nbsp; The Chairman is that world.</p>\n<p>Citizen Dawn uses waves of powerful Citizens.&nbsp; Expatriette uses powerful waves of bullets.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Awh, man! I just spit Dr. Pepper all over my keyboard.</p>",
